<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 14-day t-bill steady at 4.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 14-day t-bill steady at 4.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it maintained the cut-off at 99.81 rupees at its weekly auction of 14-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received 11 competitive bids for 16.71 billion rupees and accepted all.</p>
<p>No other bids were received, it said.</p>
<p>The face value of bills issued was 16.71 billion rupees, it said.</p>
<p>The weighted-average price was 99.81 rupees, the RBI said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
